	(descr "GY-SHT41-D SHT41 module (Teyleten Robot and similar), 13.2 x 10.4 mm, soldered straight onto the carrier on its 4-pin 0.1 in header: 1 VIN, 2 GND, 3 SCL, 4 SDA down one short edge (VIN at the top with the component side up). Hole and sensor positions on the fab layer are estimates from photos. On the bottom side it describes a module hanging under the carrier, sensor side down, 2.5 mm below on the header plastic.")
